package ReviewCenter {
    part def ChecklistService {
        doc /* Provides the review checklist: the default checklist (sections of checks, taken from the Continuous Compliance review template), the frozen copy a review keeps from its creation, and the answers. Marks sections as applicable or not (a reason is required when not), records Pass, Fail, or N/A for each check (a justification is required for Fail and N/A) with the signed-in user (user name and display name) and the UTC time, requires that the actor may see the project (`IProjectAccess`) and that the review is not approved and locked (ReviewLocked), refuses a change that would make a current signature out of date unless the caller acknowledges the affected slots (SignaturesWouldBecomeOutOfDate), refuses the author of the review to answer a check or change the applicability of a section while the project requires that authors do not answer the checklist of their own review (AuthorCannotAnswer; on by default, for every project; reads are not affected, and `ChecklistState.AuthorBlocked` tells the page), enforces these rules, and derives the progress per section and overall, completeness, and the first unanswered check. Also holds the review conclusion text of a review (a free text of at most 4000 characters, not the approved or rejected conclusion): a primary or alternate reviewer of any slot or the lead may set, change, or clear it while the review is not concluded (ReviewLocked), the change is part of the record digest and needs the acknowledgement of the affected reviewers like any other change of the record, an update that lost a race is refused (RecordChanged), and the audit entry `review.conclusion-changed` carries lengths only, never the text. */

        comment sourceRef /* Source: src/DemaConsulting.ReviewCenter.Core/ChecklistService.cs, ChecklistState.cs, ChecklistDefinition.cs, ChecklistValidator.cs, ChecklistValidationResult.cs, DefaultChecklist.cs, ReviewChecklist.cs, ChecklistAnswer.cs, ChecklistSectionState.cs, ChecklistProgress.cs, and ChecklistOutcome.cs */
        comment testRef /* Test: test/DemaConsulting.ReviewCenter.Tests/Core/ChecklistServiceTests.cs, ChecklistServiceReviewConclusionTextTests.cs, and ChecklistValidatorTests.cs */
        comment designRef /* Design: docs/design/review-center/core/checklist-service.md */
        comment verificationRef /* Verification: docs/verification/review-center/core/checklist-service.md */
        comment reqRef /* Requirements: docs/reqstream/review-center/core/checklist-service.yaml */
    }
}
